# Deliver from Chaos targets "artifact or creature" (CR 115.1), so Bot1's own Mox Ruby is a legal target for its own spell: it is
# exiled and, its mana value being 0, no Borg tokens are made (CR 107.3b, 111.2). A Swamp is neither an artifact nor a creature,
# so the same spell with that target cannot be cast at all - refused with an empty pool, so the target is the reason.

